## Development

Requires [Godot {{ godot_version }}](https://godotengine.org/download).

```bash
godot --path godot_web_game      # run the game
./export_web.sh                  # web build into godot_web_game/build/web/
./serve_on_port.sh               # serve it locally
```

Pushing to `main` deploys to GitHub Pages through the shared workflow in
[mcfredrick/crap_games](https://github.com/mcfredrick/crap_games). Running the "Update Game Registry"
workflow by hand lists the game on https://all.crap.games.

Pull in template fixes with `copier update --trust`.
